  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c710770abf287dc46b346fe2f2467822, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Apple pie,

    I was having fun reading my old
    grimoires when I stumbled upon the recipe for my favorite drink, Herbal Tea.
    Could you brew me some?

    I believe it will help me concentrate. I am also
    longing for something with mushrooms, maybe some Mushroom Stew this time?

    Happy
    brewing,'
  <LetterType>k__BackingField: 0
